35,2,1,talk,Mio,,The ledger shows fixed costs are huge. Bank statements show payment delays.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The sign-in sheets show a quarter of members do two-thirds of the work.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The rota proves it. The same nine people do everything.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The treasurer logged six hours a month chasing individual payments.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The taster forms say people want to try before they commit.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, six hours a month is a lot. That’s real work.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, that imbalance explains the hesitation. It feels unfair.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Mio, if the same nine do it all, the fee should reflect that.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, yes. The administrative burden is the hidden cost.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Jonathan, so we need a way for people to join without a full year.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,We can’t just raise the fee. We need to fix the payment flow.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Maybe a tiered system? Lower base fee, higher for heavy users.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"No. If you do the work, you pay less. That’s fair.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,A flat fee with a small admin surcharge covers the hours.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,What about a trial month? It would help the newcomers.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I like the trial month idea. It reduces the upfront fear.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,A trial month could ease the hesitation I’ve noticed.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Takumi,,I agree. But the core fee must cover the real costs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Toshio,,A flat fee with a surcharge is simplest. It covers the hours.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,Let’s go with the trial month. It keeps the door open.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
